{
  "opencollection": "1.0.0",
  "info": {
    "name": "Remote Address Details Billing API",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "request": {
    "auth": {
      "type": "oauth2",
      "flow": "client_credentials",
      "accessTokenUrl": "/auth/oauth2/token",
      "credentials": {
        "clientId": "{{clientId}}",
        "clientSecret": "{{clientSecret}}"
      }
    }
  },
  "items": [
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Billing",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Show Billing Document",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/billing-documents/:billing_document_id",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <COMPANY-SCOPED ACCESS TOKEN>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "billing_document_id",
                "value": "93t3j-billing-doc-id-9suej43",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The billing document's ID"
              },
              {
                "name": "include_unrecognized_types",
                "value": "true",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "When true, includes billing document items whose type is not part of the standard set for the invoice type."
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Shows a billing document details.\n\nPlease contact api-support@remote.com to request access to this endpoint.\n\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage invoices (`invoices`) | View invoices (`invoices:read`) | Manage invoices (`invoices:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "List Billing Documents",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/billing-documents",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <COMPANY-SCOPED ACCESS TOKEN>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "period",
                "value": "\"2023-01\"",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "The month for the billing documents (in ISO-8601 format)"
              },
              {
                "name": "page",
                "value": "1",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Starts fetching records after the given page"
              },
              {
                "name": "page_size",
                "value": "20",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Number of items per page"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "List billing documents for a company\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage invoices (`invoices`) | View invoices (`invoices:read`) | Manage invoices (`invoices:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Billing Document Breakdown",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/billing-documents/:billing_document_id/breakdown",
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "billing_document_id",
                "value": "93t3j-billing-doc-id-9suej43",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The billing document's ID"
              },
              {
                "name": "type",
                "value": "base_salary",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Filters the results by the type of the billing breakdown item."
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Get billing document breakdown\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage invoices (`invoices`) | View invoices (`invoices:read`) | Manage invoices (`invoices:write`) |\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Download a billing document PDF",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://gateway.remote.com/v1/billing-documents/:billing_document_id/pdf",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer <COMPANY-SCOPED ACCESS TOKEN>"
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "billing_document_id",
                "value": "93t3j-billing-doc-id-9suej43",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "The billing document's ID"
              }
            ],
            "auth": {
              "type": "bearer",
              "token": "{{bearerToken}}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Downloads a billing document PDF\n\n## Scopes\n\n| Category | Read only Scope | Write only Scope (read access implicit) |\n|---|---|---|\n| Manage invoices (`invoices`) | View invoices (`invoices:read`) | Manage invoices (`invoices:write`) |\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "bundled": true
}